<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa has early September capital inflow.</title>
<headline>Bovespa has early September capital inflow.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it registered foreign capital inflows of 94.5 million reais in the first 10 days of September.</p>
<p>Foreign buys amounted to 554.586 million reais, against foreign sales of 460.010 million reais.</p>
<p>In August, Bovespa saw capital inflows of 331.531 million reais.</p>
<p>So far this year, foreign capital inflows have totalled 1.674 billion reais, the bourse added.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2324411</p>
